    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859730/extras/123f478e3edb59e6c476f80c053f8262.poster.avif?t=1752145429\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859730/extras/123f478e3edb59e6c476f80c053f8262.gif?t=1752145429\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;WARNA&quot;</strong> (Indonesian for <i>&quot;color&quot;</i>) \u2013 <strong>A Gripping Indonesian Dating Sim About Love and Hidden Scars</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a tragic past, Bayu just wants a normal life at his new school in Bandung. But when he meets three girls burdened by fate, he discovers that some wounds run deeper than they appear\u2014and his own secrets might be the key to saving them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 Unique Romance Routes</strong>: Pursue a fiery soccer player, a kind student president, a shy manga artist\u2026 and uncover a secret fourth option.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stat-Driven Progression</strong>: Balance Stamina between social bonds, part-time jobs, and academics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 Core Attributes</strong>: <strong>Strength</strong> (Physical), <strong>Intelligence</strong> (Academic), and <strong>Creativity</strong> (Artistic) dynamically shape story choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Mystery Wrapped in Romance</strong>: What connects Bayu to a star athlete\u2019s burnout, an overworked president\u2019s collapse, and a reclusive artist\u2019s pain? Unravel the truth through their intertwined stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strange Visions, Unexplained Healing</strong>: Why do their injuries vanish overnight? How do those around him recover from accidents in ways that defy logic?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life-or-Death Choices</strong>: Protect those you love\u2026 or let them suffer to save yourself. Every decision has irreversible consequences.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How much would you sacrifice to paint someone else\u2019s future?</strong></p>",
